# ============================================================================
# LinkOS - Package list for x86_64
# ============================================================================
# Carefully curated to keep ISO small (~2.5-3.5 GB) while including:
#   - Base Arch system + utilities
#   - Custom XFCE desktop (no GNOME bloat)
#   - Polybar + Rofi (replaces xfce4-panel)
#   - Calamares graphical installer
#   - Gaming stack (Wine/Proton/Lutris/Steam + GPU drivers)
#   - Brave browser + Flatpak + AppImage support
#   - Fluent Dark theming
# ============================================================================

